# Non-public files in marketing/ — never serve these from the Worker.
.wrangler
node_modules
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
index.zip

# Git internals. The repo was created after this file was last reviewed, and
# the 2026-08-10 deploy shipped the whole .git directory publicly — anyone
# could fetch /.git/config and every commit object. Never serve these.
.git
.gitignore
Marketing SEO Prompt.txt
Marketing Resort Image.png

# Brand artwork masters. These are the 1536x1024 source renders the assets/
# logo-mark-*.png and wordmark-*.png files are derived from — ~2MB each, and
# they were being served publicly. Keep them here as the masters to re-export
# from, but never ship them.
Pace Lodgix Logo White.png
Pace Lodgix Wordmark v2.png
# Guard, not a live exclusion. "Marketing Image.png" was sitting loose in this
# folder unlisted, i.e. 2MB of source artwork publicly downloadable from the
# site root. It has been moved up to 01-Businesses/PaceLodgix/. The line stays
# so that dropping the file back in here cannot silently republish it.
Marketing Image.png

# Internal notes. The Worker serves this whole folder, so anything dropped in
# here is public by default, keep working docs listed.
*.md

# Raw capture masters, added 19 Sep 2026. Both are SOURCES that get processed
# into assets/, and both were sitting here unlisted, so both were publicly
# downloadable from the site root the moment this folder deploys.
#
# "Hero video.mp4" is the 4.9MB raw screen recording. The served clip is
# assets/video/hero-dashboard.mp4 (1.3MB), cropped, trimmed and re-encoded from
# it. The raw file also still has the browser address bar in frame showing a
# development URL, which is the other reason not to publish it.
#
# "Updated Screenshots/" is 2.4MB of raw app PNGs plus the Python script that
# turns them into assets/shots/app/*.webp. Nothing in it is meant to be served.
#
# Keep both HERE as the masters to re-export from. Never ship them.
Hero video.mp4
Updated Screenshots/

# Also unlisted before today: the 2026 logo master, same category as the two
# brand artwork masters above.
Pace Lodgix Mark 2026.png

# Redesign preview page — not public.
#
# preview.css and preview.js are NO LONGER LISTED HERE, and that is deliberate
# rather than an oversight. They were renamed to redesign.css / redesign.js and
# promoted: index.html now loads both, so they MUST be served or the live site
# ships with no redesign styles and no feature-grid motion. Do not re-add them.
#
# preview.html stays blocked. It is the side-by-side comparison page, it is
# noindex, and it now renders the same design as index.html — publishing it
# would put a duplicate of the homepage on a second URL.
preview.html
